=3D"7">If you accept Francis's baseline proposal, you walk away from the pr=
e-seed round controlling less than a quarter of the company. That completel=
y shatters the 70-80% high-control trajectory you initially aimed for to pr=
otect your vision as the original architect.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"8">=
